===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro}} {{term|trebuchet|lang=fro}}, {{term|trebuket}} et al. (modern {{term|trébuchet}}), from {{term|trabucher||to overthrow}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|trabuchare}}.

